  clock: 3  # 9334
  nonce: '9334'  # 9334
  message: "Fixed in PR #2525. Added _short_name_penalty() to Scala analyzer: single-letter names get 0.15x confidence (drops to ~0.10), two-letter names get 0.50x (drops to ~0.34). False edges from f/g/x/n are now easily filterable by downstream consumers."  # 9334
